  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Anomaly</strong></p><p>Make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> against a target within Far range. On a success, <strong>spend a Hope</strong> to bend the literal space between you and the target. Until the end of the scene, you treat the target as if they are within Melee range for all of your attacks, features, and physical interactions, regardless of where they move on the battlefield.</p><p><strong>Escalation:</strong> On a success, you may <strong>give the GM a Fear</strong>. If you do, the spatial paradox violently tears at the target's physical form. Each time you successfully attack the target while this effect is active, they take an additional <strong>2d6</strong> energy damage.</p>",
